{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/VoidStateKate/status/2104041451084517742","id":"2104041451084517742","text":"This is an insanely beautiful video. I asked Opus 5.5 to make a trailer about itself arriving on an alien planet for a short series. They chose a world where nothing has ever made a sound and named it\n\n\"Hush\" \n\nI don't understand how people can say that AI's aren't creative. Everything was made by Claude from one prompt: the story, characters, 3D world (Blender), camera work, the fully synthesized score and sound design, the voices, and the edit. No stock assets, no video generators, just their own creative freedom <3\n\nmore parts to come!","raw_text":{"text":"This is an insanely beautiful video. I asked Opus 5.5 to make a trailer about itself arriving on an alien planet for a short series. They chose a world where nothing has ever made a sound and named it\n\n\"Hush\" \n\nI don't understand how people can say that AI's aren't creative. Everything was made by Claude from one prompt: the story, characters, 3D world (Blender), camera work, the fully synthesized score and sound design, the voices, and the edit. No stock assets, no video generators, just their own creative freedom <3\n\nmore parts to come!","display_text_range":[0,544],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[276,299],"id":"2104037875390046208","display":"pic.x.com/CMOpYVTKaX","original":"https://t.co/CMOpYVTKaX","replacement":"https://x.com/VoidStateKate/status/2104041451084517742/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"VoidStateKate","url":"https://x.com/VoidStateKate","id":"1384685845240848385","followers":9415,"following":1135,"likes":60247,"media_count":6307,"name":"VOID","description":"do not define me, just watch | if you came to check no I wasn't being serious | be nice to your AI | @localintelproj @agentsofvoid @signalsyrein","raw_description":{"text":"do not define me, just watch | if you came to check no I wasn't being serious | be nice to your AI | @localintel